{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10123021","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10123021","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1012302101:0":{"text":"파란 나비는 미샤르테의 메신저로, 평온과 자유를 의미하지!","source_cn":"蓝色闪蝶是弥萨忒的信使，蓝色闪蝶出现，代表宁静，和自由！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x148FA0DB2462B793","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1012302102:0":{"text":"하지만 검은 나비는 어디서 온 걸까... 땅거미 숲에서는 한 번도 본 적이 없어!","source_cn":"但黑色蝴蝶是哪里来的……我从来没在薄暮丛林见过它们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5511C73E23E1D6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1012302103:0":{"text":"나도 처음 봐. 유학할 때, 가끔 나비를 본 적은 있었지만.","source_cn":"我也从未见过，在外游学时，我偶尔也能见到一些蝴蝶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98B874C9BD46EA27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012302104:0":{"text":"이 나비들은... 달라. 제발 불길한 징조는 아니었으면 좋겠는데.","source_cn":"但这些……不一样。希望它们的出现不是不祥之兆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A959B7AC0D2C93F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:埃隆":{"text":"에이론","source":"埃隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}